---
---
<section id="expertise" class="about-section">
  <div class="container about-container">
    <div class="about-visual">
      <div class="avatar-glow"></div>
      <div class="avatar-placeholder">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">About JZAP</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">The story behind our supportive mindset.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>I don't just write code; I provide <strong>critical operational support</strong>. Throughout 8 years in the trenches of IT and Fullstack Development, I learned that the best engineers aren't just solo heroes—they are the force multipliers that make the entire team succeed.</p>
        <p>The "Shadow Wave" philosophy was born from this realization. Like a dedicated healer in a raid, I anticipate system failures before they happen, buff the architecture for peak performance, and design interfaces that seamlessly guide the user.</p>
        <p>Whether you need a robust backend, a stunning frontend, or a complete architectural overhaul, I go where I'm needed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--background) 0%, var(--surface-container-lowest) 100%);
  }
  
  .about-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-xl);
    align-items: center;
  }
  
  .about-visual {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }
  
  .avatar-glow {
    position: absolute;
    width: 80%;
    height: 80%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(168, 21, 155, 0.4) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  
  .avatar-placeholder {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    background: var(--surface-container);
    border: 2px solid var(--surface-container-high);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--outline-variant);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  
  .avatar-placeholder svg {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
  }
  
  .about-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
  }
  
  .about-text strong {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  


  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }
    

  }
</style>
